Well, the dragon scale is a good idea if you already have intrinsic fire/cold
resistance. Even if I have intrinsic disintegration resistance, I often wish
for black dragon scale. This is the one armor that the nasty liches can't make
evaporate .

As for gloves, it is better to get blessed +3 gauntlets of DEXTERITY. Power
gloves make strength =25. This is fine and dandy but when strength is 18/**
you can actually carry more and do more damage than you can with str=25. 

The gloves of DEX add to your dex a number that= th + on them (i.e. +3 gauntlets
add 3 to DEX). It allows a better chance to hit the nasties. 

Other things that I wish for are blessed potions of gain ability (only if
I don't have at least 18 in everything), Stormy/ExcalibUr (note the U, people
often misspell it) if I don't already have them. And finally, a blessed 
luckstone, 'cause you can never be too lucky


